request.description:
Available: Step 9+ (dependency present). Circuit breaker state visible: Step 10+.

Returns Spring Boot's composite health including:
  - db: H2 database connectivity
  - circuitBreakers.accountService: CLOSED / OPEN / HALF_OPEN (Step 10+)

Expected response shape:
{
  "status": "UP",
  "components": {
    "circuitBreakers": {
      "status": "UP",
      "details": {
        "accountService": {
          "details": { "state": "CLOSED", ... }
        }
      }
    },
    "db": { "status": "UP" },
    ...
  }
}
